'''Outer Rim Supply Co.''' was a company that was active in [[the galaxy]]. An advertisement for the company could be found in [[Stobar Spaceport]] during the [[Clone Wars]],<ref name="Brothers" /> and [[Horizon Base]] during the [[Galactic Civil War]].<ref name="Droid">{{Rebels|The Forgotten Droid}}</ref> A [[Painting|poster]] with the company's logo was used to decorate [[Joopa Base]], the home of [[Clone trooper|clone veterans]] [[Rex]], [[Wolffe]] and [[Gregor]].<ref name="Relics">{{Rebels|Relics of the Old Republic}}</ref> An [[Ugnaught]] worker at [[Reklam Station]] had a sticker with the company's logo on their [[helmet]].<ref name="Steps">''[[Star Wars Rebels: Steps Into Shadow]]''</ref>

Decades later, the company was advertised on a large screen on the [[Fuel|refueling]] [[Space station|station]] ''[[Colossus]]'', showcasing info about an upcoming [[racing starfighter]] race.<ref name="Recruit">{{Resistance|The Recruit}}</ref> The business' logo was also featured on [[Hype Fazon]]'s racing starfighter ''[[Green Ace]]''<ref name="Bucket">{{SW|url=news/buckets-list-extra-the-high-tower-star-wars-resistance|text=Bucket's List Extra: 9 Fun Facts from "The High Tower" - ''Star Wars Resistance''|date=2018-10-29}} {{C|Slide 6}}</ref> and on the chassis of Fazon's [[astromech droid]] [[R4-G77]],<ref name="SW-Designing Star Wars: Star Wars Resistance">{{SW|url=news/designing-star-wars-resistance|text=Designing ''Star Wars'': ''Star Wars Resistance''|author=[[Kristin Baver]]|date=2019-03-11}} {{C|Slide 12}}</ref> while the cube motif from the logo was printed on Fazon's [[flight suit]].<ref name="Bucket" />

